ition-colors\">团队协作</p><span class=\"text-lg grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all\">👥</span></div><p class=\"text-3xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\">多角色</p><p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed mt-1 group-hover:text-zinc-400 transition-colors\">权限与审阅流</p></div></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.03] px-6 py-5 hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-colors\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-zinc-500 group-hover:text-primary/80 transition-colors\">发布效率</p><span class=\"text-lg grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all\">🚀</span></div><p class=\"text-3xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\">7 倍</p><p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed mt-1 group-hover:text-zinc-400 transition-colors\">减少 80% 重复排版</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"container mx-auto px-6 py-20 lg:py-32\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-16\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary\">CORE FEATURES</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-foreground md:text-5xl tracking-tight\">核心功能，<span class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-white to-zinc-500\">覆盖内容全链路</span></h2><p class=\"text-lg text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl\">从创作、适配到分发与回收，确保每一篇内容都拥有一致的质感与表现力。</p></div><a href=\"/pricing\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight transition-all duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary/60 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-white disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed cursor-pointer active:translate-y-px h-11 py-2 rounded-full px-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 border border-white/5\">查看定价</button></a></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0A0E17] p-8 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-white/10 hover:shadow-[0_0_50px_-20px_rgba(0,136,255,0.2)]\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,rgba(0,136,255,0.1),transparent_70%)]\"></div><div class=\"relative mb-6 inline-flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/20 shadow-[0_0_20px_-5px_rgba(0,136,255,0.3)] backdrop-blur-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_-5px_rgba(0,136,255,0.5)] group-hover:ring-primary/50\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" class=\"text-primary h-8 w-8 drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(0,136,255,0.5)]\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"10\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fill-primary/10\"></rect><rect x=\"28\" y=\"6\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fill-secondary/20\"></rect><rect x=\"18\" y=\"28\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fill-primary/10\"></rect><path d=\"M13 20c0 8 8 6 10 6s12-2 12 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M35 16c0 6-6 6-10 6s-12 0-12 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"relative text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">多平台同步发布</h3><p class=\"relative text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\">一次创作，自动匹配排版规则，一键分发公众号、知乎、视频号、抖音、B站、小红书等主流渠道。</p></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0A0E17] p-8 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-white/10 hover:shadow-[0_0_50px_-20px_rgba(0,212,255,0.2)]\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,rgba(0,212,255,0.1),transparent_70%)]\"></div><div class=\"relative mb-6 inline-flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/20 shadow-[0_0_20px_-5px_rgba(0,136,255,0.3)] backdrop-blur-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_-5px_rgba(0,136,255,0.5)] group-hover:ring-primary/50\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" class=\"text-secondary h-8 w-8 drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(0,136,255,0.5)]\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M11 30 30 11\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M15 33c0 1.7-1.3 3-3 3s-3-1.3-3-3 1.3-3 3-3 3 1.3 3 3Zm24-15c0 1.7-1.3 3-3 3s-3-1.3-3-3 1.3-3 3-3 3 1.3 3 3Z\" class=\"fill-current\"></path><path d=\"M26 38c0 1.7-1.3 3-3 3s-3-1.3-3-3 1.3-3 3-3 3 1.3 3 3Z\" class=\"fill-[#00e581]\"></path><rect x=\"22\" y=\"14\" width=\"4\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1.6\" class=\"fill-current\"></rect><rect x=\"30\" y=\"22\" width=\"4\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1.6\" class=\"fill-[#00e581]\"></rect></svg></div><h3 class=\"relative text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">智能格式转换</h3><p class=\"relative text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\">AI 识别段落、标题、引用与代码块，避免手动调整格式，保持品牌一致性。</p></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0A0E17] p-8 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-white/10 hover:shadow-[0_0_50px_-20px_rgba(0,136,255,0.15)]\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,rgba(94,234,212,0.1),transparent_70%)]\"></div><div class=\"relative mb-6 inline-flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/20 shadow-[0_0_20px_-5px_rgba(0,136,255,0.3)] backdrop-blur-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_-5px_rgba(0,136,255,0.5)] group-hover:ring-primary/50\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" class=\"text-primary h-8 w-8 drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(0,136,255,0.5)]\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"10\" width=\"32\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\" class=\"fill-primary/10\"></rect><path d=\"M14 30V18h4l3 4 3-4h4v12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"m30 26 4 4 4-4\" stroke=\"#00d4ff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"relative text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">Markdown 专业体验</h3><p class=\"relative text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\">所见即所得预览、大纲导航、快捷片段与实时校对，让内容更快、更稳定地定稿。</p></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0A0E17] p-8 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-white/10 hover:shadow-[0_0_50px_-20px_rgba(0,136,255,0.15)]\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,rgba(99,102,241,0.1),transparent_70%)]\"></div><div class=\"relative mb-6 inline-flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/20 shadow-[0_0_20px_-5px_rgba(0,136,255,0.3)] backdrop-blur-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_-5px_rgba(0,136,255,0.5)] group-hover:ring-primary/50\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" class=\"text-[#001a4d] h-8 w-8 drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(0,136,255,0.5)]\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M24 8 12 12v10c0 7.2 4.4 13.9 12 18 7.6-4.1 12-10.8 12-18V12L24 8Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M18 24.5 22 28l8-10\" stroke=\"#00e581\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"relative text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">云端存储与安全</h3><p class=\"relative text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\">版本回溯、团队协作、权限与审阅流，全程加密传输，保证数据可追踪更安心。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"container mx-auto px-6 py-20 relative\"><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-primary/5 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6 mb-16 relative z-10\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary\">FLOW</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-foreground md:text-5xl tracking-tight\">内容流水线，<span class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-secondary to-primary\">自动完成每一步</span></h2><p class=\"text-lg text-zinc-400\">将创作、适配、发布和反馈串联成流动的体验。</p></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 backdrop-blur-md transition-all hover:bg-white/[0.04] hover:border-white/10\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between mb-8\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-500 uppercase group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">STEP 01</span><span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/5 text-sm font-bold text-zinc-400 ring-1 ring-white/10 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-white group-hover:ring-primary transition-all\">1</span></div><h3 class=\"relative text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">创作 &amp; 导入</h3><p class=\"relative text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">直接写作或导入 Markdown/文档，自动提取结构与素材。</p><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1 w-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-full opacity-50\"></div></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 backdrop-blur-md transition-all hover:bg-white/[0.04] hover:border-white/10\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between mb-8\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-500 uppercase group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">STEP 02</span><span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/5 text-sm font-bold text-zinc-400 ring-1 ring-white/10 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-white group-hover:ring-primary transition-all\">2</span></div><h3 class=\"relative text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">智能适配</h3><p class=\"relative text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">AI 调整标题、摘要、封面与格式，生成多平台最佳版本。</p><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1 w-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-full opacity-50\"></div></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 backdrop-blur-md transition-all hover:bg-white/[0.04] hover:border-white/10\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between mb-8\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-500 uppercase group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">STEP 03</span><span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/5 text-sm font-bold text-zinc-400 ring-1 ring-white/10 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-white group-hover:ring-primary transition-all\">3</span></div><h3 class=\"relative text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">一键分发</h3><p class=\"relative text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">批量定时发布，浏览器插件支持跨平台快速登录与推送。</p><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1 w-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-full opacity-50\"></div></div><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 backdrop-blur-md transition-all hover:bg-white/[0.04] hover:border-white/10\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between mb-8\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-500 uppercase group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">STEP 04</span><span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/5 text-sm font-bold text-zinc-400 ring-1 ring-white/10 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-white group-hover:ring-primary transition-all\">4</span></div><h3 class=\"relative text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">数据回收</h3><p class=\"relative text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">实时查看发布结果，回流评论与数据，优化下一篇内容。</p><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1 w-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-full opacity-50\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container mx-auto px-6 py-20\"><div class=\"rounded-[40px] border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 md:p-12 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_0_80px_-40px_rgba(0,136,255,0.2)]\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6 mb-12\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary\">PLATFORMS</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-foreground md:text-4xl\">全面支持的内容矩阵</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-zinc-400\">覆盖主流长短内容平台，并可通过插件/导出链接拓展更多渠道。</p></div><div class=\"rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary border border-primary/20\">持续新增</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"group flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/5 p-4 transition-all hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/10 hover:scale-[1.02]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white/10 ring-1 ring-white/10 group-hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors\"><img alt=\"微信公众号 logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 tra