r from-white/[0.03] to-white/[0.01] p-10 backdrop-blur-xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-8\"><div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/20 to-secondary/20 text-primary ring-1 ring-white/10\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" class=\"text-[#001a4d] h-7 w-7\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M24 8 12 12v10c0 7.2 4.4 13.9 12 18 7.6-4.1 12-10.8 12-18V12L24 8Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M18 24.5 22 28l8-10\" stroke=\"#00e581\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary\">SECURITY &amp; GOVERNANCE</p><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-1\">安全、稳定、可审计的内容管线</h3></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/5 p-5 hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200\">权限与审阅</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-500\">多角色流程，避免误发与越权。</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/5 p-5 hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200\">版本留存</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-500\">自动快照与回滚，记录每次修改。</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/5 p-5 hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200\">数据加密</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-500\">全程 TLS，加密存储敏感凭据。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[40px] border border-white/5 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/20 via-primary/5 to-background p-10 backdrop-blur-xl\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-primary/20 blur-[80px] pointer-events-none\"></div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary relative z-10\">READY TO FLOW</p><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-3xl font-bold text-white relative z-10\">把内容交给字流，让创作回归本身</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 relative z-10\">无论是个人创作者还是团队品牌，都能用同一套流程完成创作、适配、发布与复盘。</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 relative z-10\"><a href=\"/auth/signup\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap tracking-tight duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary/60 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-white disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed cursor-pointer active:translate-y-px bg-gradient-to-r from-primary via-[#3b82f6] to-secondary text-white active:scale-[0.98] border border-white/10 h-11 rounded-xl px-8 py-6 text-base font-semibold shadow-[0_0_30px_-10px_rgba(0,136,255,0.6)] hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-10px_rgba(0,136,255,0.8)] hover:scale-105 transition-all\">立即开始</button></a><a href=\"/extension\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap font-semibold tracking-tight duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary/60 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-white disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed cursor-pointer active:translate-y-px border shadow-[0_4px_20px_-10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] hover:border-white/20 transition-all h-11 rounded-xl border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-6 py-6 text-base text-zinc-300 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white backdrop-blur\">安装插件</button></a></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"border-t border-white/5 bg-[#020617]/80 backdrop-blur-xl\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 py-16\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr_1fr_1fr] items-start\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary via-[#3b82f6] to-secondary text-white shadow-[0_0_20px_-5px_rgba(0,136,255,0.5)]\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold\">Z</span></div><div><p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white\">字流 Ziliu</p><p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider\">Content Distribution</p></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-sm\">AI 驱动的多平台内容分发工具，一次创作，智能适配并分发到公众号、知乎、B站、抖音等全渠道。</p></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-white\">产品</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm text-zinc-500\"><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"#features\">功能概览</a><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/pricing\">定价</a><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/dashboard\">工作台</a><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/extension\">浏览器插件</a></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-white\">资源</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm text-zinc-500\"><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\">博客 / 更新</a><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/MCBVwctYYiqO6rkz5iAcRYN0nEU?from=from_copylink\">使用指南</a><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/faq\">常见问题</a></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-white\">支持</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm text-zinc-500\"><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/auth/signup\">开始试用</a><button class=\"text-left hover:text-primary transition-colors\">联系客服</button><button class=\"text-left hover:text-primary transition-colors\">返回顶部</button></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-6 text-xs text-zinc-600\"><p>© 2025 字流 Ziliu. All rights reserved.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\"><span class=\"cursor-pointer hover:text-zinc-400\">隐私政策</span><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-700\"></span><span class=\"cursor-pointer hover:text-zinc-400\">服务条款</span></div></div></div></footer></main><div class=\"fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-4